#: ../../library/wave.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!wave` --- Read and write WAV files"
msgstr ":mod:`!wave` --- 读写 WAV 文件"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/wave.py`"
msgstr "**源代码:** :source:`Lib/wave.py`"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!wave` module provides a convenient interface to the Waveform "
"Audio \"WAVE\" (or \"WAV\") file format."
msgstr ":mod:`!wave` 模块提供了针对 Waveform Audio \"WAVE\" (或 \"WAV\") 文件格式的便捷接口。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:14
msgid ""
"The module supports uncompressed PCM and IEEE floating-point WAV formats."
msgstr "本模块支持未压缩 PCM 和 IEEE 浮点 WAV 格式。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:18
msgid ""
"Support for ``WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE`` headers was added, provided that the "
"extended format is ``KSDATAFORMAT_SUBTYPE_PCM``."
msgstr ""
"增加了对 ``WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE`` 标头的支持，要求扩展格式为 ``KSDATAFORMAT_SUBTYPE_PCM``。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:23
msgid ""
"Support for reading and writing ``WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT`` files was added."
msgstr "增加了对读写 ``WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT`` 文件的支持。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:25
msgid "The :mod:`!wave` module defines the following function and exception:"
msgstr ":mod:`!wave` 模块定义了以下函数和异常："

#: ../../library/wave.rst:30
msgid ""
"If *file* is a string, a :term:`path-like object` or a :term:`bytes-like "
"object` open the file by that name, otherwise treat it as a file-like "
"object.  *mode* can be:"
msgstr ""
"如果 *file* 是一个字符串、:term:`path-like object` 或 :term:`bytes-like object` "
"则打开指定名称的文件，否则把它作为文件型对象来处理。 *mode* 可以是："

#: ../../library/wave.rst:34
msgid "``'rb'``"
msgstr "``'rb'``"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:35
msgid "Read only mode."
msgstr "只读模式。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:37
msgid "``'wb'``"
msgstr "``'wb'``"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:38
msgid "Write only mode."
msgstr "只写模式。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:40
msgid "Note that it does not allow read/write WAV files."
msgstr "注意不支持同时读写 WAV 文件。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:42
msgid ""
"A *mode* of ``'rb'`` returns a :class:`Wave_read` object, while a *mode* of "
"``'wb'`` returns a :class:`Wave_write` object.  If *mode* is omitted and a "
"file-like object is passed as *file*, ``file.mode`` is used as the default "
"value for *mode*."
msgstr ""
"*mode* 设为 ``'rb'`` 时返回一个 :class:`Wave_read` 对象，而 *mode* 设为 ``'wb'`` 时返回一个 "
":class:`Wave_write` 对象。如果省略 *mode* 并指定 *file* 来传入一个文件型对象，则 ``file.mode`` "
"会被用作 *mode* 的默认值。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:47
msgid ""
"If you pass in a file-like object, the wave object will not close it when "
"its ``close()`` method is called; it is the caller's responsibility to close"
" the file object."
msgstr "如果你传入一个文件型对象，当调用 wave 对象的 ``close()`` 方法时并不会真正关闭它；调用者需要负责关闭文件对象。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:51
msgid ""
"The :func:`.open` function may be used in a :keyword:`with` statement.  When"
" the :keyword:`!with` block completes, the :meth:`Wave_read.close` or "
":meth:`Wave_write.close` method is called."
msgstr ""
":func:`.open` 函数可以在 :keyword:`with` 语句中使用。 当 :keyword:`!with` "
"代码块结束时，:meth:`Wave_read.close` 或 :meth:`Wave_write.close` 方法会被调用。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:55 ../../library/wave.rst:194
msgid "Added support for unseekable files."
msgstr "添加了对不可查找文件的支持。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:58
msgid ""
"Added support for :term:`path-like objects <path-like object>` and "
":term:`bytes-like objects <bytes-like object>`."
msgstr ""
"增加对 :term:`路径型对象 <path-like object>` 和 :term:`字节型对象 <bytes-like object>` "
"的支持。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:64
msgid ""
"An error raised when something is impossible because it violates the WAV "
"specification or hits an implementation deficiency."
msgstr "当不符合 WAV 格式规范或遇到实现缺陷时引发的错误。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:70
msgid "Format code for uncompressed PCM audio."
msgstr "未压缩 PCM 音频的格式代码。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:75
msgid "Format code for IEEE floating-point audio."
msgstr "IEEE 浮点音频的格式代码。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:80
msgid "Format code for WAVE extensible headers."
msgstr "WAVE 可扩展标头的格式代码。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:86
msgid "Wave_read Objects"
msgstr "Wave_read 对象"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:90
msgid "Read a WAV file."
msgstr "读取一个 WAV 文件。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:92
msgid ""
"Wave_read objects, as returned by :func:`.open`, have the following methods:"
msgstr "由 :func:`.open` 返回的 Wave_read 对象，有以下几种方法:"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:97
msgid ""
"Close the stream if it was opened by :mod:`!wave`, and make the instance "
"unusable.  This is called automatically on object collection."
msgstr "关闭由 :mod:`!wave` 打开的流，并使实例不可用。 此方法会在对象回收时自动调用。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:103
msgid "Returns number of audio channels (``1`` for mono, ``2`` for stereo)."
msgstr "返回声道数量 (``1`` 为单声道，``2`` 为立体声)。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:108
msgid "Returns sample width in bytes."
msgstr "返回采样字节长度。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:113
msgid "Returns sampling frequency."
msgstr "返回采样频率。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:118
msgid "Returns number of audio frames."
msgstr "返回音频总帧数。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:123
msgid "Returns the frame format code."
msgstr "返回帧格式代码。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:125
msgid ""
"This is one of :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_PCM`, :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT`, or "
":data:`WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE`."
msgstr ""
"这是 :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_PCM`, :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT` 或 "
":data:`WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE` 中的一个。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:131
msgid "Returns compression type (``'NONE'`` is the only supported type)."
msgstr "返回压缩类型（只支持 ``'NONE'`` 类型）。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:136
msgid ""
"Human-readable version of :meth:`getcomptype`. Usually ``'not compressed'`` "
"parallels ``'NONE'``."
msgstr ":meth:`getcomptype` 的人类可读版本。通常 ``'not compressed'`` 对应 ``'NONE'``。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:142
msgid ""
"Returns a :func:`~collections.namedtuple` ``(nchannels, sampwidth, "
"framerate, nframes, comptype, compname)``, equivalent to output of the "
"``get*()`` methods."
msgstr ""
"返回一个 :func:`~collections.namedtuple` ``(nchannels, sampwidth, framerate, "
"nframes, comptype, compname)``，等价于 ``get*()`` 方法的输出。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:149
msgid ""
"Reads and returns at most *n* frames of audio, as a :class:`bytes` object."
msgstr "读取并返回以 :class:`bytes` 对象表示的最多 *n* 帧音频。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:154
msgid "Rewind the file pointer to the beginning of the audio stream."
msgstr "重置文件指针至音频开头。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:157
msgid ""
"The following two methods define a term \"position\" which is compatible "
"between them, and is otherwise implementation dependent."
msgstr "以下两个方法定义了一个在二者间通用的\"位置\"概念，在其他方面则依赖于具体实现。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:163
msgid "Set the file pointer to the specified position."
msgstr "设置文件指针到指定位置。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:168
msgid "Return current file pointer position."
msgstr "返回当前文件指针位置。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:174
msgid "Wave_write Objects"
msgstr "Wave_write 对象"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:178
msgid "Write a WAV file."
msgstr "写入一个 WAV 文件。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:180
msgid "Wave_write objects, as returned by :func:`.open`."
msgstr "Wave_write 对象，由 :func:`.open` 返回。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:182
msgid ""
"For seekable output streams, the ``wave`` header will automatically be "
"updated to reflect the number of frames actually written.  For unseekable "
"streams, the *nframes* value must be accurate when the first frame data is "
"written.  An accurate *nframes* value can be achieved either by calling "
":meth:`setnframes` or :meth:`setparams` with the number of frames that will "
"be written before :meth:`close` is called and then using "
":meth:`writeframesraw` to write the frame data, or by calling "
":meth:`writeframes` with all of the frame data to be written.  In the latter"
" case :meth:`writeframes` will calculate the number of frames in the data "
"and set *nframes* accordingly before writing the frame data."
msgstr ""
"对于可查找的输出流，``wave`` 头将自动更新以反映实际写入的帧数。 对于不可查找的流，当写入第一帧时 *nframes* 值必须是准确的。 "
"要获取准确的 *nframes* 值可以通过调用 :meth:`setnframes` 或 :meth:`setparams` 并附带 "
":meth:`close` 被调用之前将要写入的帧数然后使用 :meth:`writeframesraw` 来写入帧数据，或者通过调用 "
":meth:`writeframes` 并附带所有要写入的帧。 在后一种情况下 :meth:`writeframes` "
"将计算数据中的帧数并在写入帧数据之前相应地设置 *nframes*。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:197
msgid "Wave_write objects have the following methods:"
msgstr "Wave_write 对象具有以下方法:"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:201
msgid ""
"Make sure *nframes* is correct, and close the file if it was opened by "
":mod:`!wave`.  This method is called upon object collection.  It will raise "
"an exception if the output stream is not seekable and *nframes* does not "
"match the number of frames actually written."
msgstr ""
"确保 *nframes* 正确，并关闭由 :mod:`!wave` 打开的文件。 此方法会在对象回收时调用。 如果输出流不可查找且 *nframes* "
"与实际写入的帧数不匹配，将引发异常。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:209
msgid "Set the number of channels."
msgstr "设置声道数。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:214
msgid "Return the number of channels."
msgstr "返回声道数。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:219
msgid "Set the sample width to *n* bytes."
msgstr "设置采样宽度为 *n* 个字节。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:221
msgid ""
"For :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT`, only 4-byte (32-bit) and 8-byte (64-bit)"
" sample widths are supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:227
msgid "Return the sample width in bytes."
msgstr "返回以字节数表示的采样宽度。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:232
msgid "Set the frame rate to *n*."
msgstr "设置采样频率为 *n*。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:234
msgid "A non-integral input to this method is rounded to the nearest integer."
msgstr "对此方法的非整数输入会被舍入到最接近的整数。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:241
msgid "Return the frame rate."
msgstr "返回帧速率。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:246
msgid ""
"Set the number of frames to *n*.  This will be changed later if the number "
"of frames actually written is different (this update attempt will raise an "
"error if the output stream is not seekable)."
msgstr "设置总帧数为 *n*。 如果与之后实际写入的帧数不一致此值将会被更改（如果输出流不可查找则此更改尝试将引发错误）。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:253
msgid "Return the number of audio frames written so far."
msgstr "返回已写入的音频帧数。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:258
msgid ""
"Set the compression type and description. At the moment, only compression "
"type ``NONE`` is supported, meaning no compression."
msgstr "设置压缩格式。目前只支持 ``NONE`` 即无压缩格式。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:264
msgid "Return the compression type (``'NONE'``)."
msgstr "返回压缩类型 (``'NONE'``)。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:269
msgid "Return the human-readable compression type name."
msgstr "返回人类可读的压缩类型名称。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:274
msgid "Set the frame format code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:276
msgid ""
"Supported values are :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_PCM` and "
":data:`WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:279
msgid ""
"When setting :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT`, the sample width must be 4 or 8"
" bytes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:285
msgid "Return the current frame format code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:290
msgid ""
"The *tuple* should be ``(nchannels, sampwidth, framerate, nframes, comptype,"
" compname, format)``, with values valid for the ``set*()`` methods. Sets all"
" parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:294
msgid ""
"For backwards compatibility, a 6-item tuple without *format* is also "
"accepted and defaults to :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_PCM`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:297
msgid "For ``format=WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT``, *sampwidth* must be 4 or 8."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/wave.rst:302
msgid ""
"Return a :func:`~collections.namedtuple` ``(nchannels, sampwidth, framerate,"
" nframes, comptype, compname)`` containing the current output parameters."
msgstr ""
"返回包含当前输出形参的 :func:`~collections.namedtuple` ``(nchannels, sampwidth, "
"framerate, nframes, comptype, compname)``。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:309
msgid ""
"Return current position in the file, with the same disclaimer for the "
":meth:`Wave_read.tell` and :meth:`Wave_read.setpos` methods."
msgstr ""
"返回当前文件指针，其指针含义和 :meth:`Wave_read.tell` 以及 :meth:`Wave_read.setpos` 是一致的。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:315
msgid "Write audio frames, without correcting *nframes*."
msgstr "写入音频数据但不更新 *nframes*。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:317 ../../library/wave.rst:328
msgid "Any :term:`bytes-like object` is now accepted."
msgstr "现在可接受任意 :term:`bytes-like object`。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:323
msgid ""
"Write audio frames and make sure *nframes* is correct.  It will raise an "
"error if the output stream is not seekable and the total number of frames "
"that have been written after *data* has been written does not match the "
"previously set value for *nframes*."
msgstr ""
"写入音频帧并确保 *nframes* 是正确的。 如果输出流不可查找且在 *data* 被写入之后写入的总帧数与之前设定的 *nframes* "
"值不匹配将会引发错误。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:331
msgid ""
"Note that it is invalid to set any parameters after calling "
":meth:`writeframes` or :meth:`writeframesraw`, and any attempt to do so will"
" raise :exc:`wave.Error`."
msgstr ""
"注意在调用 :meth:`writeframes` 或 :meth:`writeframesraw` "
"之后再设置任何格式参数是无效的，而且任何这样的尝试将引发 :exc:`wave.Error`。"

#: ../../library/wave.rst:335
msgid ""
"For :data:`WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT` output, a ``fact`` chunk is written as "
"required by the WAVE specification for non-PCM formats."
msgstr ""
